WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Begin in plank, then shift your weight onto the right hand and outer right foot.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Stack the left foot over the right (or stagger for balance).

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Press firmly through the bottom hand and lift the hips high.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Reach the top arm toward the ceiling, opening the chest.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Gaze up past the top hand, hold, then lower and switch sides.
